    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Following that legendary style, Uchu Mega Fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fighting action game</strong> in which aliens with <strong>dismembered bodies</strong> fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With familiar <strong>pixel art</strong> and <strong>simple controls</strong>, anyone can enjoy the fun of fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/extras/0a71531b725fd901ea599fe0435e63f4.avif?t=1752607812\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a <strong>power style</strong> that does not require combos, and a <strong>modern style</strong> that allows for one-button special moves. Beginners and fighting gamers can play together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limited character participation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kyanta&quot; from &quot;Ultra Fight! Kyanta 2&quot; will be participating in the Steam version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/extras/fc24d80ab36bf6111b0596bed8f06995.avif?t=1752607812\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Following that legendary style, Uchu Mega Fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fighting action game</strong> in which aliens with <strong>dismembered bodies</strong> fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With familiar <strong>pixel art</strong> and <strong>simple controls</strong>, anyone can enjoy the fun of fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/extras/0a71531b725fd901ea599fe0435e63f4.avif?t=1752607812\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has a <strong>power style</strong> that does not require combos, and a <strong>modern style</strong> that allows for one-button special moves. Beginners and fighting gamers can play together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Limited character participation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Kyanta&quot; from &quot;Ultra Fight! Kyanta 2&quot; will be participating in the Steam version!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2503920/extras/fc24d80ab36bf6111b0596bed8f06995.avif?t=1752607812\" /></span></p>",
